---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumb from '../components/astro/Breadcrumb.astro';
---
<SiteLayout title="Gibraltar For Sale — About" description="About Gibraltar For Sale: locally specific area guides, practical buyer resources and a commitment to source-check market information." image="/images/editorial/gibraltar-city-by-beach.webp">
  <Breadcrumb items={[{ label: 'About' }]} />
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-[1000px] px-5 pb-20 pt-10 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:pb-28 lg:pt-16">
    <p class="text-xs font-extrabold uppercase tracking-[.18em] text-sea-700">About this guide</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 font-display text-5xl font-semibold leading-tight text-ink-900 sm:text-6xl">A clearer view of property in Gibraltar</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 max-w-3xl text-base leading-8 text-stone-600">Gibraltar For Sale is an independent property-information website for people comparing areas, learning how a purchase works and planning a move. The current site focuses on practical local context and sourced buyer information.</p>
    <div class="article-content mt-10">
      <h2 id="what-is-here">What you'll find here</h2>
      <p>Eight area guides and practical articles about buying, costs, residence, mortgages, renting, viewings and new builds. Market pages explain what evidence would be needed before an estimate is useful. Source links remain with relevant guidance so readers can check details directly.</p>
      <h2 id="what-is-not-here">What is not live</h2>
      <p>There are no verified property listings, agent directory, developer profiles, public enquiry form, email-alert system or current private-market dataset. We do not display fictional property or partner details as real. Contact and enquiry services are not currently open.</p>
      <h2 id="how-we-approach-claims">How we approach claims</h2>
      <p>Property status and price should be tied to a source and update date. Legal, tax and residence matters should point to official information and qualified local advice. General website guidance cannot decide eligibility, value a particular home or replace a solicitor, accountant, lender or immigration professional.</p>
      <h2 id="visual-material">Photographs and concept images</h2>
      <p>Location photos are credited to their creators and used to show Gibraltar's setting, not a particular property. AI-generated residential scenes are labelled as concept imagery and are not homes for sale.</p>
    </div>
  </article>
</SiteLayout>
